(328, 'Nourish New York, NYS Dept. of Health and Dept. of Agriculture and Markets (state-funded, LFPA-style purchasing)', 'State', 'NY', 'State funds food banks and emergency food providers to buy NY-grown or NY-processed food (51%+ NY ingredients); a market channel, not a grant to the hub', 'Startup; Scaling; Mature', 'Not stated (purchase orders via Nourish NY Portal)', 'None', 'Open: permanent program since Nov 2021; sellers can register on the Nourish NY Portal at any time', 'Any business selling eligible NY products can list on the portal, so hubs, aggregators and processors can sell to food banks. Buyers are food banks and emergency food providers. Budget not stated on the page.', 'https://agriculture.ny.gov/nourishny', '2026-11-22', false),
