(430, 'AFID Facility Grants (Governor''s Agriculture and Forestry Industries Development Fund), VDACS', 'State', 'VA', 'Discretionary, performance-based incentive for new or expanding agriculture value-added or processing facilities (produce, dairy, meat, specialty food)', 'Scaling; Mature', 'Not stated (set by Secretary of Agriculture and Forestry, approved by Governor)', 'Not stated (guidelines PDF not opened)', 'Rolling, deal-by-deal', 'Locality receives the grant on behalf of the company; grant must be critical to the project. Fits larger hub/processing expansions with job and Virginia-grown purchase commitments.', 'https://www.vdacs.virginia.gov/agriculture-afid-facility-grants.shtml', '2026-11-22', false),
